Under EP3 and on K600, all with ViT-B/16 (Table~\ref{tab:ep3}), STDD reaches 85.2\,$\pm$\,1.2 on UCF101 (FROSTER 84.8\,$\pm$\,1.1; Open-VCLIP++ 83.9\,$\pm$\,0.6), 55.9\,$\pm$\,0.2 on HMDB51 (Open-VCLIP++ 55.6\,$\pm$\,1.4; AP-CLIP 55.4\,$\pm$\,0.8) and 75.1\,$\pm$\,0.7 on K600 (FROSTER 74.8\,$\pm$\,0.9; AP-CLIP 73.4\,$\pm$\,1.0). The margins over the strongest baselines are small and sometimes within the reported standard deviations.

